        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Briana Corrigan, Dave Hemingway\n- Songs: \"A Little Time\"\n- Albums: Choke\n- Bands: The Beautiful South, South\n- Places: Northern Ireland\n\nFacts:\n- Briana Corrigan was born on 30 May 1965.\n- Briana Corrigan is a Northern Irish singer.\n- \"A Little Time\" consists of a duet featuring vocalists Dave Hemingway and Briana Corrigan.\n- \"A Little Time\" was the first and only number 1 single for South.\n- The release of \"A Little Time\" pushed the album Choke to number 2 in the charts.",
